# Line endings for a byte-stable plugin tree
#
# `plugins/greatwall-agent/` is the original Antigravity plugin, and
# `plugins/dsh-greatwall-agent/greatwall-agent/` is its byte-identical copy pinned
# by `core-manifest.sha256`. With `core.autocrlf=true` (the Windows default) a
# clone would rewrite LF to CRLF and make `node tools/verify-core.mjs` fail
# through no fault of the package, so Git must never translate endings there.
#
# Everything else is ordinary text stored with LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
plugins/greatwall-agent/** -text
plugins/dsh-greatwall-agent/** -text
